      (dimFl (CMType H) (D.p + D.q) + 1) o₀.𝔐.X o₁.𝔐.X oR.𝔐.X o₀.𝔐.ξ o₁.𝔐.ξ oR.𝔐.ξ M₀.arith M₁.arith Rf.arith
